{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？今天小乾請假？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0586", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，這麼說來她早上也沒來社團。」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔也沒有在校門口看見小紗同學。」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "ag3427", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果，昨天紗凪沒有回社團教室。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是瀨名同學來了，她說紗凪身體突然不舒服。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以後來是瀨名同學把美羽帶去紗凪的家。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒事吧……打電話給她看看吧？」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不需要擔心。是感冒啦，感冒。她現在一定在睡覺，打電話過去只會吵到她。」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 408, "voice": "ar4400", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近天氣變冷了嘛～」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0587", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我家的地板也冷得誇張。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾的家怎麼樣？果然是那種地暖系統完善的大豪宅？」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0588", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不知道欸，紗凪也是大小姐……嗎？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔覺得那種神秘的部分對女孩子來說是很重要的。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "ag3428", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「全身上下都很神秘的女僕都這樣說了，一定不會錯。」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0589", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，因為女僕只會在未來的主人面前展現出自己的全部喔。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "ag3429", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛～找不到吧？安潔的主人……」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0590", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太同學，你是叫安潔去死嗎？」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "ag3430", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我沒有要把你逼到絕境的意思啦。」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0591", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎麼說，我還是很擔心紗凪的缺席。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼大家輪流幫她抄上課筆記吧？期末考也快到了……」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好喔，我排第一個吧，下午好像會打瞌睡。」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0592", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女生的健康教育課就交給安潔。」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "ag3431", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剩下的就由我跟瀨名同學分擔可以吧？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我一個人抄就好了，你不用。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 408, "voice": "ar4401", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼可以，只有我不幫忙心裡也會怪怪的。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你幫忙的話，會惹紗凪不開心吧。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 408, "voice": "ar4402", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾還沒有讓小乾接受你啊？」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0593", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，她連眼神都不跟我對上。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0594", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哈哈，笑不出來。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小紗凪果然請假了啊……打電話給她也沒接，我好擔心。」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1369", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學說好像是感冒。昨天她沒回社團也是這個原因。」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒事吧……小紗凪常常會逞強。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1370", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊不也是嗎？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已經反省過了，不會再逞強了喔。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1371", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前還因此給新吾君和小櫻乃添了麻煩……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1372", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊下意識地伸出手想牽我，但是突然意識到自己的動作而收了回去。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……感覺好像會上癮呢。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1373", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟喜歡的人牽手。」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1374", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊小聲地說，然後俏皮地吐舌頭。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想到那種不分場合大馬路上放閃的情侶，好像稍微能理解他們的心情了。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每當和學姊說話，我就想要盡可能地與她肢體接觸。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "旁人的視線都無所謂了。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，來找你了……」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1375", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……下次換我去三年級的教室吧？」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那樣不行～」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1376", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼？」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「三年級沒有和各務台學園的試驗班，全部都是女孩子。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1377", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君去那種地方的話，你覺得會怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1378", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……呃？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家都因為煩惱升學就業的事情累積了很多壓力，要是出現了年輕男孩子的話……」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1379", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，接下來的事情我說不出口……」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1380", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然有點想惡作劇一下逼她說出口。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是新奇，學姊居然會說這種話……", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔～新吾你在這啊。接下來是體育課，差不多該去換衣服了喔～」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0595", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，知道了。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽學姊好～」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0596", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1381", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？我臉上有沾到什麼嗎？」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0597", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，沒有，什麼都沒有。新吾君，待會見囉！」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1382", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，待會見。」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「椋梨君待會見……沒有說欸。」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0598", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽著隼太的喃喃自語，我向學姊揮手道別。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0599", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，我們去換衣服吧……」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等等，換衣服前麻煩你詳細解釋一下。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0600", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「詳細解釋？」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔！？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太突然搭上我的肩膀，還對我的肚子灌了一拳。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你跟天羽學姊是不是發生了什麼？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0601", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什、什麼都沒有啊。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管，給我老實說！什麼都沒有的男女會笑著揮手說再見嗎？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0602", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟美羽學姊的關係被懷疑了。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過對隼太也沒有必要刻意隱瞞。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也希望班上能至少有一個理解我的人。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那你可以保證不會對任何人說嗎？」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼，你在跟天羽學姊交往嗎？」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0603", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我什麼都還沒說啊。」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一般人都猜得到吧，看到你們那種互動。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0604", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們的情侶關係真的有那麼明顯嗎？", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不注意一點的話，會被大家看穿的。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「居然是跟那個天羽學姊啊……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0605", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然很不相配吧？我跟美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有那種事吧？新吾你很適合那種姊姊類型的女生喔。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0606", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎？」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不太會依賴別人對吧？所以至少女朋友要選能撒嬌的對象。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0607", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且天羽學姊好像會很寵你的感覺～」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0608", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，呃……」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己是希望她能對我撒嬌啦，不過考慮到學姊的個性……", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『可是……我對新吾君，好像會做出可能把你弄壞的各種事情……』", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1383", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不知道這種狀況是不是該高興。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，這件事不要告訴大家……」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道啦。我會一邊偷笑一邊溫馨地旁觀你們的。」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0609", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是糟糕的興趣。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，你要小心點喔。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0610", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小心點？」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋，你稍微冷靜思考看看。」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0611", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像天羽學姊這樣博愛主義的人，至今為止都對動物一視同仁地灌注愛情。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0612", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種深不見底的愛情現在全部都灌注在你身上了喔？」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0613", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我很擔心你啊新吾。你能承受得了那個人全力放送的愛的電流嗎？」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0614", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該會強得讓人麻痺吧。」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在被麻痺之前先麻痺她！」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0615", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太用力地一掌拍在我的背上。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，你就算交了女朋友也要偶爾跟我出去玩喔～」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0616", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這當然，我也是這麼希望的。」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，還要看天羽學姊同不同意啦。」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0617", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊的話會同意的。」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎？她那種類型感覺意外地會忌妒戀人的朋友喔～」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0618", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "目前為止，我還沒有感覺到學姊有那種情緒。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "反而她完全不忌妒還比較讓我不安。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之就是這樣啦。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0619", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「恭喜你。」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "ht0620", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕呼！？」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "腹部又被灌了一拳，疼痛與喜悅參半。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊。原來椋梨君注意到了我們的關係。」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1384", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我收到他的祝福外加兩拳了。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼。真好呢，有能聊那種話的朋友。」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1385", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～嚕～」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 425, "voice": "pn0374", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放學後，社團教室裡只有我們兩人，美羽學姊變成只屬於我的戀人。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她突然牽我的手時，我忍不住雀躍了起來。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊真的好嬌小，只要她在身邊我就想抱住她。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得被同性也仰慕的人真的很棒呢～」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1386", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊不也是這樣嗎？」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有喔～我就沒有能夠聊新吾君的事的朋友。」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1387", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是學姊給人會收到很多女孩子送的情人節巧克力的印象……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為一直念女校吧。大家常常會交換巧克力。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1388", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「順便問一下，學姊收過多少個巧克力呢？」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個……大約５０個左右吧。」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1389", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "位數差太多了。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這樣的人當我的女朋友，真的可以嗎？", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我開始擔心會不會被女生們怨恨了。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，對了。二年級快要期末考了吧？」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1390", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒錯，下個禮拜就是期末……」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你有念書嗎？」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1391", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「完全沒有。應該說，根本沒空念。」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的腦中全部都是學姊，連一個英文單字都塞不進去。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不想想辦法的話，成績一定會很悲慘。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那明天和後天要不要來我家一起念書？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1392", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……可以嗎？」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，美羽老師會很嚴厲教導你的喔～」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1393", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……這麼可愛的老師是犯規吧。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是「美羽老師」這個叫法，我就已經知道自己絕對念不進去了。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼樣？還是你已經有約了？」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1394", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有，我沒有約。那就拜託妳了，美羽老師。」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已經放棄期末考了。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "週末就跟美羽老師快樂度過吧。嗯。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被你叫美羽老師，感覺好害羞喔。」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1395", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還是叫妳天羽老師比較好？」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1396", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 425, "voice": "pn0375", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想被新吾君叫美羽老師♪」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "mu1397", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再見了，期末考……", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
